    "jobDescription": "<p>Should have experience at least 5 years in the field of Hydrology &amp; Hydraulics in Hydro Electric power/water resources projects with Civil Engineering Background with the following technical requirements:&nbsp;</p><p>1)Estimation of Design flood &amp; water Availability studies with respect to the approval agencies of CWC and State Energy Directorates.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>2)Power Potential Studies for the run-of-river schemes, storage/Peak power Hydro Electric Projects.</p><p>3)Fixing the General Layout Plan of the Hydroelectric project based on the respective hydraulic calculations &amp; other Hydrology/hydraulic parameters.&nbsp;</p><p>4)Should Have good hand on the hydraulics/water related Soft wares such as Hec-RAS, Water Hammer, Arc-GIS, Auto-CAD, Dam Break Analysis, Finite Element Analysis (FEM) etc.</p><p>5)Experience on Design of Hydraulics/Diversion Structures (Barrage, Dam (earthen/gravity), weirs, coffer dam etc.), Spillway Capacity &amp; knowledge on provision of emergency evacuation arrangements through dams, Energy Dissipation Arrangements, cross drainage structures etc.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>6)Experience on the Regression Analysis to carryout the hydrological Studies.</p><p>7)Should have knowledge on Flood routing (Channel Routing, reservoir routing etc.)</p><p>8)Thorough knowledge on Application IS codes, American &amp; European Standards related to the Hydraulics, Hydrological studies &amp; Dam for Hydroelectric projects.</p><p>9)Preparation of DPR level Design, Documents, &amp; Drawings for getting approval from the State &amp; Central Govt. agencies.</p><p>10)Should have experience for preparation of Technical Specification &amp; drawings for Tender Documents.</p><p>11)Review, Optimization &amp; value addition of Consultants Design &amp; Drawings for construction stage of Hydroelectric projects.&nbsp;</p><p>12)Experience on preparation of Details designs &amp; drawings for the construction project and able to travel frequently for site visits as required.</p><p>13)Should have experience in application of different type of turbines, pumps &amp; valve specially in Hydroelectric projects.&nbsp;</p><p>14)Should have experience for development of BoQ &amp; Cost Estimates for the hydroelectric projects.&nbsp;</p><p>15)Having Experience in Pumped Storage Project is an additional advantage.</p><p>16)Having Knowledge on application of BIM Software is an additional advantage.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
